flowchart TD
  Request[HTTP request] --> Bearer[Bearer API key]
  Bearer --> Principal[reader or admin Principal]
  Principal --> RouteRole[HTTP route role check]
  RouteRole --> SQLRole[SQL AuthContext for SQL statements]
  SQLRole --> Txn[Snapshot transaction]
  Txn --> Commit[Commit / conflict detection]
  Commit --> Response[HTTP result or typed error]
  Request --> Limits[Rate, body, session, row, statement limits]
  Request --> Obs[Request IDs, metrics, bounded events]
